#### truecolor-80-dark
Usage: tidewater [options] [command]

Options:
  -v, --verbose <level>       Print more while working
  -h, --help                  display help for command

Build:
  build                       Build the project

Commands:
  export                      Export the project
  import                      Import a project
  publish <target> [channel]  Publish the project
  help [command]              display help for command

License:
  license                     Activate, sign in, devices and updates

